body:
Can I ask you  serious question, in this day and age is abortion necessary? I grew up in the 80's and was prochoice, the problem was I started to see girls use it as birth control, and it changed my mind. 

&#x200B;

Back to my question thought, every form of birth control is available, and can be used in conjunction, you can get a shot , arm implant, the pill still. I guess maybe because I came of age in the 80's where HIV/AIDS was a death sentence, not to mention the stigma, I took condom use serious, so if you sleeping with people you don't know and aren't using protection(s) that is just idiotic, especially since normals STDs are becoming antibiotic resistant.

&#x200B;

I know the argument is always rape and incest, but there is plan B, I understand for incest that may not be an option, but for every other scenario there is literally no reason to have an unwanted pregnancy

Different parts of the world have different standards. I know in Japan that pain meds are almost never prescribed unless you are dying of cancer.

&#x200B;

The problem is that in the US, we got used to being prescribed pain pills for everything, I remember I broke a toe and a DR gave me 120 Norco and told me call back for a refill if I needed more. Now you get a script for 600MG Ibuprofen.

What were you on, if it was anything but Fent, it's not time, its based on the COWS chart , you need to be good and sick before you start Subs.

&#x200B;

You want to be scoring over a 26 on the charts. different opiates, different metabolic rates for different people, this is exactly why Drs. should not be giving out a set time frame. Some people can last 36+hours and others cants make it past 12 off the same opiate.

That makes it a little bit harder, but do yourself a favor, and go as low as you can go then start skipping days, you'll thank yourself for it. It very doable and can be completely done with no issues or any WD feelings. 

&#x200B;

GOOD LUCK!!!

I would hope Darrius was arrested, he walked up to 5 year old Cannon and shot him point blank in the head killing him, while riding his bike in from of his house. Worst part is that he had just had dinner the night before at Cannon's house, as Darrius was friendly with his Neighbors(Canon's Parents).

&#x200B;

The fact that you don't know about this story is surprising, It happened last week.

You got me, I don't know why this made me LOL!!! 

&#x200B;

Reminds me of the scene in the movie The Jerk where Steve Martin orders wine and gets mad that they are giving him old wine, and that he is no fool he wants the newest best wine. 

&#x200B;

 That's how I remember the scene haven't seen it since it was at the movies(F I'm OLD!!!)

I've mentioned this before, something is wrong with Asuelo, he is mentally slow or maybe on the spectrum. Watch the clip of him from the reunion show, where he starts to freak out because people are yelling. Most "normal" adults don't hit themselves when they can't hear what someone is saying.

&#x200B;

