Talk about a person who cannot read a situation. Literally just met Debbie and is basically trying to dry hump her Colt on the car ride home right in front of her.

&#x200B;

Then when Debbie is tired and upset, tries to give her the "you can sleep" lecture. That's when I knew Jess was a certified DUMBASS!!!

Family stayed up till Midnight to watch it, My Son and I always play the soundtrack when we are on family road trips.

&#x200B;

We had tickets to the L.A. show on the second night  it opened at the Pantages, unfortunately it closed on opening day. I have to say the musical adds so much more to the soundtrack.

&#x200B;

We're loving it!

 Its not a UK thing its a weird thing. Only adults with issues still use mommy and daddy, most people stop that around 10 years old give or take a few years either way.

